{"id":"a8485bd5a48a9fe0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-category-laws.md","title":"稀疏性的等价、理想与余稀疏滤子","display":"thm-category-laws — 稀疏性的等价、理想与余稀疏滤子","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-category-laws","aliases":["20-thm-category-laws"],"display":"thm-category-laws — 稀疏性的等价、理想与余稀疏滤子","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercises 14.1.6–14.1.7","source_printed_pages":[213,214],"source_pdf_pages":[242,243],"depends_on":["[[20-df-category]]","[[20-thm-baire-category]]","[[20-df-closure-tree]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-category-laws"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-category-laws</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-category-laws — 稀疏性的等价、理想与余稀疏滤子"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercises 14.1.6–14.1.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>213</span><span>214</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>242</span><span>243</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"249ce19d50d1f381\" href=\"?note=249ce19d50d1f381\" title=\"20-thm-baire-category\">20-thm-baire-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"683b778af72202b5\" href=\"?note=683b778af72202b5\" title=\"20-df-closure-tree\">20-df-closure-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,A_n\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A,A_n\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Countable}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Countable}(A)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\\le\\aleph_0\">\\(|A|\\le\\aleph_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"249ce19d50d1f381\" href=\"?note=249ce19d50d1f381\" title=\"20-thm-baire-category\">20-thm-baire-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"683b778af72202b5\" href=\"?note=683b778af72202b5\" title=\"20-df-closure-tree\">20-df-closure-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}category-laws}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FirstCategory}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Countable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Meager}(A_n))\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(\\bigcup_nA_n),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Comeager}(A_n))\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(\\bigcap_nA_n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Meager}(A)\\land|A|&gt;\\aleph_0.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}category-laws}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FirstCategory}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Countable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Meager}(A_n))\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(\\bigcup_nA_n),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Comeager}(A_n))\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(\\bigcap_nA_n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Meager}(A)\\land|A|&gt;\\aleph_0.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_nN_n\">\\(A=\\bigcup_nN_n\\)</span> 且各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_n\">\\(N_n\\)</span> nowhere dense，则闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{N_n}\">\\(\\overline{N_n}\\)</span> 的补集稠密开，其交落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的补集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> meager。反向，若稠密开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 的交避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_n(A\\cap(2^\\omega\\setminus U_n))\">\\(A=\\bigcup_n(A\\cap(2^\\omega\\setminus U_n))\\)</span>，各交集 nowhere dense。</p>\n<p>单点 nowhere dense，因为任何柱都能缩小到不含指定点；所以可数集合 meager。可数个 meager 集用可数配对把各自的 nowhere dense 分解合并；取补集给 comeager 交封闭。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 同时 comeager 与 meager，其本身和补集各包含一个稠密开集的可数交，合并这些开集后 Baire 定理给一个同时在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与补集中的点，矛盾。若 comeager 集可数，由前项又 meager，亦矛盾。子集保持 meager，超集保持 comeager，由同一分解直接得到。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 213–214 / PDF 242–243。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-baire-category","status":"resolved","id":"249ce19d50d1f381","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-baire-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closure-tree","status":"resolved","id":"683b778af72202b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closure-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]；see [[20-df-closure-tree]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-baire-category","status":"resolved","id":"249ce19d50d1f381","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]；see [[20-df-closure-tree]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closure-tree","status":"resolved","id":"683b778af72202b5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]；see [[20-df-closure-tree]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]；see [[20-df-closure-tree]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,A_n\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Countable}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"|A|\\le\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}category-laws}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FirstCategory}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Countable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(A),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Meager}(A_n))\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meager}(\\bigcup_nA_n),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Comeager}(A_n))\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(\\bigcap_nA_n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Meager}(A)\\land|A|>\\aleph_0.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_nN_n","display":false},{"tex":"N_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{N_n}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_n(A\\cap(2^\\omega\\setminus U_n))","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2237,"backlinks":[{"id":"677e7c9793466351","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-category-laws]]。"}],"outgoing":["e3e4bc829c39df8c","249ce19d50d1f381","683b778af72202b5","35073b74f84433b3"]}